{
  "slug": "gnosis-mcp",
  "name": "Gnosis Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Zero-config knowledge base for AI coding agents. Loads your markdown docs into a searchable database and exposes them as MCP tools — search, read, and manage documentation without leaving your editor. Works instantly with SQLite (no setup), upgrades to PostgreSQL + pgvector for hybrid semantic search. Includes skills for searching docs (/gnosis:search), health checks (/gnosis:status), doc management (/gnosis:manage), and first-time setup (/gnosis:setup). 6 MCP tools, 3 resources, F...",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **6 agents**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `context` (Load usage-weighted context from Gnosis MCP), `eval` (Measure retrieval quality on your corpus — Hit@5, MRR, nDCG@10, Precision@5), `ingest` (Populate the gnosis-mcp knowledge base — from local files, git history, or a crawled website), `manage` (CRUD operations on the knowledge base — add, delete, update metadata), `search` (Search the gnosis-mcp knowledge base), `setup` (First-time setup wizard for Gnosis MCP), `status` (Verify gnosis-mcp server connectivity, schema integrity, and corpus health), `tune` (Find the chunk-size and retrieval config that maximizes quality on YOUR corpus)\n- **Agents** (6): `context-loader` (Lightweight context primer — loads relevant docs into conversation context before starting work), `corpus-sync` (Bulk-ingestion specialist — runs the full ingest / re-ingest / prune / crawl / git-history lifecycle via shell…), `doc-explorer` (Fast documentation navigator — search, read, follow the link graph, cross-reference code), `doc-keeper` (Documentation maintainer — index new docs, update stale content, run the full corpus lifecycle (files, git history, web…), `doc-reviewer` (Code-aware documentation reviewer — checks docs for accuracy against the actual codebase), `README`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `gnosis`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gnosis-mcp@claude-community` from `nicholasglazer/gnosis-mcp`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "agent": 6,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
